### Directwerk — Tenant analytics (Umami read API)
### Prerequisites: 02-oauth2.http (tenantAAccessToken), 10-tenant-admin.http (branding with umamiWebsiteId).
### The API logs in to Umami server-to-server; set DIRECTWERK_ANALYTICS_UMAMI_USERNAME /
### DIRECTWERK_ANALYTICS_UMAMI_PASSWORD (and optional ..._UMAMI_API_BASE_URL) on the API.

### @name getAnalyticsStats7d
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tenant/analytics/stats/7d
Host: {{tenantAHost}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantAAccessToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### @name getAnalyticsStats12m
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tenant/analytics/stats/12m
Host: {{tenantAHost}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantAAccessToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### @name getAnalyticsStatsUnknownRange
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tenant/analytics/stats/13d
Host: {{tenantAHost}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantAAccessToken}}
Accept: application/json
